    titleZh: "搭乘凌晨航班回家",
    summaryEn:
      "The final row in the detailed image is cropped, so the booking confirmation must be the authority for flight number, terminal and arrival time.",
    summaryZh:
      "详细图片的最后一行被裁切，因此航班号、航站楼与到达时间必须以预订确认单为准。",
